OL,3,APolice Scotland carrying out 'active
OL,4,Ainquiries' into Andrew and Epstein
OL,5,ABalmoral visits
OL,6,
OL,7,FSex offender Epstein - who died in 2019
OL,8,F- and Maxwell, who was jailed in 2022
OL,9,Ffor sex trafficking, are understood to
OL,10,Fhave visited the castle with
OL,11,FMountbatten-Windsor, who has previously
OL,12,Fdenied any wrongdoing.
OL,14,FPolice Scotland said inquiries were at
OL,15,F"a very early stage" and that it would
OL,16,Fbe inappropriate to comment further.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
