OL,3,AResidents leave devastated
OL,4,ARussian-occupied Oleshky as evacuation
OL,5,Acorridor opens
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe evacuation of the Russian-occupied
OL,8,FUkrainian city of Oleshky is under way,
OL,9,FRussian and Ukrainian authorities have
OL,10,Fconfirmed.
OL,12,FA ceasefire, brokered by US First Lady
OL,13,FMelania Trump, has been in force in the
OL,14,Fentire frontline region of Kherson
OL,15,Fsince Tuesday, allowing for the road
OL,16,Fout of Oleshky to be demined.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
